  "notes": "{輸出|ゆしゅつ} means export, referring to sending goods or services abroad for sale. It functions as a noun and can form a verb with する.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive)\n- No standard intransitive pair\n- Pattern: [noun]を{輸出|ゆしゅつ}する\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {輸出|ゆしゅつ}する: to export\n- {輸出|ゆしゅつ}⟦{品|ひん}→品：03712_hin⟧: export goods\n- {輸出|ゆしゅつ}⟦{業|ぎょう}→〜業：noentry⟧: export industry\n- {輸出|ゆしゅつ}⟦{額|がく}→額：02607_gaku⟧: export value/amount\n- {輸出|ゆしゅつ}⟦{規制|きせい}→規制：02598_kisei⟧: export restrictions\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{輸入|ゆにゅう}→輸入：01742_yunyuu⟧: import (opposite)\n- ⟦{輸出入|ゆしゅつにゅう}→輸出入：noentry⟧: import and export\n- ⟦{貿易|ぼうえき}→貿易：01727_boueki⟧: trade\n- ⟦{海外|かいがい}→海外：00134_kaigai⟧⟦{向|む}け→向け：11011_muke⟧: for overseas markets",
